  questDescription: Bah, Farmer Hank here. The handle snaps every time I toss a hay
    bale, so make it properly sturdy. The prongs should be decently sharp, but nothing
    crazy, I only stab hay.
  requirements:
  - type: 1
    tier: 2
  - type: 3
    tier: 2
  successText: Well, I'll be! Hay flies like butter and nothing snaps! Best fork
    ever!
  partialText: Hmph. It's a fork. It forks. Fine.
  failureText: Useless! I've met turnips with more sense than this fork!
